<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens 1996 profits by product group.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens 1996 profits by product group.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>Profit by product group in millions of guilders</p>
<p>    Steel					     427  vs  720</p>
<p>    Aluminium					  43  vs  140</p>
<p>    Technical services			     20  vs   16</p>
<p>    Other activities			  56 loss  vs   66 loss</p>
<p>    Total					     434  vs  810</p>
<p>    Tax						 109  vs  286</p>
<p>    Net profit on ordinary activities	 325  vs  524</p>
